# What `COPY . .` in src/Yalla.Api/Dockerfile must not pick up.
#
# bin/ and obj/ above all: a Windows checkout carries obj/project.assets.json files resolved
# against the host's NuGet cache, and a Linux restore inside the image that finds them
# builds against the wrong graph or fails outright. Everything else here is simply not an
# input to the image - and the deploy folder holds the server's .env, which must never be
# copied into a layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
artifacts/
deploy/
docs/
tests/
*.md
*.sh
.env
.env.*
